# Ignore all
*
!*/

# Add metadata and build files
!.gitignore
!.dockerignore
!**/Dockerfile
!**/Makefile
!**/pyproject.toml
!**/requirements*
!**/*.lock
!**/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!**/.keep
!**/py.typed

# Add Python code
!**/*.py
**/.*_cache
**/__pycache__

# Add configs and scripts (but not env!)
!**/*.graphql
!**/*.json
!**/*.sql
!**/*.yaml
!**/*.yml
!**/*.sh
!**/*.j2

# Docs
!docs/**
docs/_build

dipdup_indexer
.claude/settings.local.json
